# wyoming-whisper — speech-to-text for Home Assistant.
#
# The model is a GLOBAL: EXIST_MODEL_STT (and EXIST_MODEL_STT_LANGUAGE) in
# .env.shared, read straight from docker-compose.yml at container start.
# Nothing to set here.
#
# Sizes, on CPU, for short voice commands:
#   tiny      fastest, noticeably worse on names and numbers
#   base      the default — near-instant on a few cores, good enough for commands
#   small     better accuracy, roughly 2-3x the latency
#   medium    accurate, too slow for conversational voice on most homelab CPUs
#
# For long recordings with speaker labels, use whisperx instead — that runs on
# the GPU and is a different job (see the auto-transcription quest).
